  "description": "With a single touch, Detective Dong Baek can read anyone’s memory. Thanks to his supernatural skill, he’s gotten cocky over his virtually flawless track record. But a mysterious serial killer ends up mystifying even his supernatural ability, and a genius criminal profiler is brought in to close the case. Dong Baek will have to swallow his pride and work with her if they want any hope of stopping the slaughter… \n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 5 side stories.*",
